#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reducing the Trotter error of Hamiltonian dynamics with multi-product formulas"
msgstr "Mengurangi error Trotter pada dinamika Hamiltonian dengan formula multi-produk"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-addons/mpf/01_getting_started.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-addons/mpf/01_getting_started.ipynb\" />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this notebook, you will learn how to use a **Multi-Product Formula (MPF)** to achieve a lower Trotter error on our observable compared to the one incurred by the deepest Trotter circuit that we will actually execute.\n"
"You will do so by working through the steps of a **Qiskit pattern**:\n"
msgstr ""
"Di notebook ini, kamu akan belajar cara menggunakan **Multi-Product Formula (MPF)** untuk mendapatkan error Trotter yang lebih kecil pada observable kita dibandingkan error yang dihasilkan oleh Circuit Trotter terdalam yang benar-benar akan kita eksekusi.\n"
"Kamu akan melakukannya dengan mengikuti langkah-langkah dalam sebuah **pola Qiskit**:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 1: Map to quantum problem**\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 1: Petakan ke masalah kuantum**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Initialize our problem's Hamiltonian\n"
msgstr "Inisialisasi Hamiltonian masalah kita\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "<font color=\"#0F62FE\">Use an MPF to generate the Trotterized time-evolution circuits</font>\n"
msgstr "<font color=\"#0F62FE\">Gunakan MPF untuk membangkitkan Circuit evolusi waktu Trotterized</font>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 2: Optimize the problem**\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 2: Optimalkan masalah**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here we transpile our circuits for a [GenericBackendV2](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.fake_provider.GenericBackendV2)\n"
msgstr "Di sini kita melakukan transpilasi Circuit kita untuk sebuah [GenericBackendV2](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.fake_provider.GenericBackendV2)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 3: Execute experiments**\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 3: Jalankan eksperimen**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use a [StatevectorEstimator](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.StatevectorEstimator) for sake of simplicity in this notebook\n"
msgstr "Gunakan [StatevectorEstimator](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.StatevectorEstimator) untuk kemudahan di notebook ini\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 4: Reconstruct results**\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 4: Rekonstruksi hasil**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
